stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED: atomic run budget outbox
    QUEUED --> RUNNING: transactional claim and fencing token
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: atomic artifact publication and accepted hash
    COMPLETED --> INGESTED: verified idempotent ingestion
    INGESTED --> [*]
    RUNNING --> LOST_UNRESOLVED: lease expired identity uncertain
    LOST_UNRESOLVED --> COMPLETED: recover fenced published result
    LOST_UNRESOLVED --> QUEUED: confirmed dead and retry budget available
    RUNNING --> FAILED: bounded execution failure
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: campaign cancellation
    RUNNING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED: campaign cancellation
    CANCEL_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED: child stopped and acknowledged
    CANCEL_REQUESTED --> LOST_UNRESOLVED: cannot establish stopped
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
